WEBVTT

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:50.720
You'll definitely remember, Kaito!

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.200
Seira!

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:12.110
Seira, I'll definitely get your orange heart shards back!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.860
Intrusion of Love

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:23.120
Lucia-san! Do you know what time it is!?

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.190
Everyone's waiting for you{ all this time}!

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:29.550
{That's because }I forgot to set my alarm clock last night!

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:32.570
Listen! You need to hurry up and get ready.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.220
I know! I know!

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.170
Oww!

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:42.910
That's...

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:50.310
Are you really going to keep my place clean, Lucia?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:54.150
Yeah. You can't just leave and not it taken care of.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:58.290
While you're in Hawaii, I'll clean up your place and air it out.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.590
Sorry for making you do this.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:05.660
When you come back, we'll have a party at your place to celebrate your victory in the surfing competition.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:06.620
Okay!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.080
Kaito...

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.530
That's strange.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:19.820
I just went to wake up Lucia-san. Could she have gone back to sleep?

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.880
I guess there's no choice but for us to go and wake her up.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.280
Karen, you and the others go on ahead to the beach house.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:28.720
Lucia?

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.160
Oh, you're awake.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:36.250
Lucia, if you don't hurry, we'll be late getting to Maki-san's beach house so we can help out.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.160
Hmm? What's that key?

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.400
Kaito gave me this key. It's the key to his place.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.340
L-Lucia-san! You have Kaito's key!

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.300
W-When did you do such immoral things with him!?

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.840
Hippo, you talk too much, so shut up!

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:54.730
I promised Kaito that I would clean his place while he was in Hawaii.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.770
But I haven't even gone once.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.790
So why don't you go to Kaito-kun's place and clean it up for him today?

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.720
Since it's been shut up for a while, the place could be growing mold!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:15.040
But Kaito doesn't even remember my promise to clean his place.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:19.370
If it were me, the existence of a promise isn't important. I'd definitely go and clean it.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.320
But...

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:25.750
Plus, if you're spacing out at the beach house, you might break dishes in the process.

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.540
Maki-san would be quite troubled.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.220
Hanon. Rina.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:33.100
If the two of you put it that way, I'll {go }make a visit.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:42.890
The summer sun feels really wonderful, Kaito.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.960
Yeah, it really does.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:49.590
I wonder if I'll be healthy enough to play in the water next summer.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.140
You'll definitely be able to play in the water.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.540
It would be nice if that were the case.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.670
You'll need to get better for that.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.320
Yeah!

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.740
Ahh! My hat!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.060
Watch out, Mikaru!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.830
Are you okay, Mikaru?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:15.600
Hey! Stop that! Mikaru!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:17.860
Mikaru!

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.620
Hey! Hang in there, Mikaru!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.030
Mikaru!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:40.120
I knew it. Kaito hasn't been in here.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:49.910
Kaito.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.650
No! Now is not the time to mope!

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.970
I need to hurry and clean his place so I can go to the beach house!

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:09.560
SPLASH DREAM!

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:09.560
Splash Dream!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.520
Inori wa ya no you ni

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.520
A prayer like an arrow

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.630
Nanatsu no umi meguri

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.630
Revolving about the seven seas

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:20.540
Toumei na ai wo inuku

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:20.540
With distinctly clear love, striking people where it goes.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.830
Ahh! It's hot water! Where's the faucet!? The faucet!

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:33.920
Are you okay, Mikaru?

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.110
Where's Kaito?

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.280
He went to the pharmacy to buy you some medicine.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:45.520
My goodness. He was with you and allowed for this to happen.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:46.920
It's not Kaito's fault.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:52.340
Onii-sama, please don't scold Kaito.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.390
Mikaru.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.650
We'll just leave it at that. Go ahead and rest.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:04.270
Kiite mune no hajikete tobichiru nan darou

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:04.270
When listening to my heart, it bursts open and flies about, just what is this?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:07.710
By the time I get out of the bath, my clothes should be dry.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:14.520
Oh yeah. I think I've got an ice bag at my place.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:16.440
I'd better get that as well.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:19.910
Huh? The window's open! Why?

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.610
The door's unlocked, too.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.330
Eh? Those are Lucia's shoes.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:30.100
Are the clothes dry by now?

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:33.160
Lucia? Are you here?

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.870
K-Kaito!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.100
Lucia? Are you in the bathroom?

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:41.170
K-Kaito! Why are you here?

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.540
Why? This is my place.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:45.650
I... guess that's true...

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.710
Then why are you in someone else's bathroom, taking a bath?

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:52.380
I-I'm sorry for using your bathroom without asking.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.080
I'll get out as soon as I can!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.100
How could Kaito have come back?

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.010
I-I'm sorry, Kaito.

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.700
While I was cleaning your bathroom, my clothes got wet.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.620
Look, you...

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:18.540
Uhh, Kaito, can you help me get my clothes?

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.710
O-Okay. These?

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.010
How embarrassing!

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.450
I'm sorry, Kaito.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.410
Eh!?

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:29.960
W-What are you doing, Kaito!?

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.280
O-Oh no! Wait a minute!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.950
My heart isn't ready yet!

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.970
Your clothes aren't dry yet. Put this on.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:43.330
That was scary. My heart felt like it was about to burst.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.090
Kaito.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.300
Fa... ther...

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.010
What is wrong, Mikaru? Are you hurting anywhere?

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.920
Father, I...

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.180
Father?

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:09.550
Father, the wings... the wings...

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:10.540
Mikaru...

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.090
D-Did you call for me?

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.360
Is Mikeru still in pain?

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.250
Yeah, I think so.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:46.930
But I think Mikeru-sama can now control all of his personality.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:49.930
What about the Mermaid Princesses?

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:53.380
They haven't been as easy to deal with.

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:54.900
Is that an excuse?

00:09:54.900 --> 00:10:00.680
N-No! We just need to start by assessing how much power the Mermaid Princesses have.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.140
Then this is perfect.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:02.550
Huh?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:06.860
I've made something new. Take it.

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:17.710
I will send my burning heart throughout the world!

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.880
I'm Alala!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.530
Nice to meet you!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:22.510
Huh?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.780
She's a bit weird{unusual}, but she should be useful.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:26.900
Really?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.410
I'm firing at your heart!

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:32.290
IT'S HOT!!!!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.500
But that was really a surprise.

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.490
At first, I thought a burglar was in here.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:42.210
You had some guts to go into my place.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.830
But how did you get in, anyway?

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:52.830
You must have sneaked in somehow.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.620
Huh? What's wrong, Lucia?

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:57.530
Do you feel okay?

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.150
Are you crying?

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:04.450
H-Hey... you're acting weird.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.870
Yeah, I'm acting weird.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:08.780
Eh?

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:18.720
Just seeing you and talking with you... made me think of everything that happened before.

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:22.090
It was a bit embarrassing, but still I felt happy.

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.320
My heart is full of emotions.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:30.090
The fact that you'd forgotten about me only felt like a bad dream.

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:30.900
Lucia.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:35.860
Kaito, why do you think I have a key to your place?

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:39.080
Why do you think I'm here?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.480
You don't know, right?

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:43.500
That's...

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:52.980
When I think that I no longer exist in your heart, everything happy that's happened becomes sad.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:55.010
I feel really lonely!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:58.300
You're mean, Kaito!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.460
You've forgotten all about me!

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.400
You're mean! You're mean!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.350
Lucia...

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:16.250
I'm... going home.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:25.990
Lucia.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.990
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.570
Hey, how's this?

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.990
Is this pose cute? What do you think?

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.800
Hey, how about this one?

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:46.370
Should I use this one?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.820
W-Which one? Any of them seem okay to me.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:54.070
N-No, I think all of them are really cute! Yeah!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:59.010
She's an idiot. Can she really be of any use?

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:02.560
You don't have to be so troubled. Everything will be all right.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:06.620
I'll get rid of the Mermaid Princesses. Just you wait and see.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:07.370
Right?

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.120
Oww! It's hot! It's hot!

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.030
Oh my.

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:16.100
Ugh, that really hurt.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.040
I've been given a weirdo.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:25.500
How am I going find a good way to lure the Mermaid Princesses out for her debut?

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:29.990
Hehe! I've found something good!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.320
I'll use that as bait!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.120
Kaito...

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.240
Kaito's scent is so nostalgic.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.590
But, Kaito... Kaito is...

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:01.880
No matter what, it's ridiculous that she hasn't come back!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:05.100
Lucia probably got over-excited and cleaned the place to exhaustion.

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.830
Maybe she's taking an afternoon nap there?

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:09.280
That... could be.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.090
My goodness, Lucia.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.960
Everyone's looking out for her...

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.190
Hey, Hanon!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.430
W-What?

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:16.680
Come here for a bit.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.570
What is it? What's going on?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.260
Look over there. It's Kaito.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:25.100
Eh!? Why is Kaito-kun over there?

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.840
Lucia must have run into Kaito.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.410
No wonder why she's running late.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:33.800
Lucia said that she was going there to do some cleaning.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.310
Maybe the two already arranged this meeting beforehand?

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:40.960
Eh!? The clothes airing outside... don't they belong to Lucia!?

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.390
Eh!? Then that means...

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.000
No way!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:50.830
S-So, in order for Lucia to make Kaito-kun remember, she went to such extremes!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.760
C-Calm down, Hanon!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:55.680
Lucia couldn't possibly do something like that!

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.930
What do we do, Rina?

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:01.210
Should we go to Kaito-kun's place and take a look?

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.920
If we do, are we going to complicate things?

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:07.610
I guess if you put it that way, I think we should trust them for now.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:10.090
You say to trust them...

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:20.600
Well, I've got her debut set up, as requested.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.560
Everyone on the oil tanker!

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.090
Sorry to keep you all waiting!

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:27.070
What in the world?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.670
What's going on?

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:34.730
The super-idol Alala-chan is here, and she's going to set your hearts on fire!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.650
Yay! How is everyone?

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:44.450
Today is my memorable debut concert!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:47.990
Everyone, please have a lot of fun!

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:27.100
What's going on? There's a lot of smoke coming from that boat!

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.090
Oh no!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.660
Who are you?

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:37.210
Are you another servant of Mikeru?

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:42.280
I'm Alala. I'm the debuting pichi pitch idol!

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.440
Pichi pitch idol?

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.690
Eh? Are you treating me as some sort of idiot?

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.550
You're really cute.

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.530
I'm... cute?

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.780
Y-You think so?

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:59.720
All cute girls are my rivals.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:00.320
Huh?

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:04.360
I will destroy all my rivals and become the top idol!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:08.120
I will bring my burning heart to everyone in the world!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.600
Eh? Lucia is in danger!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.340
Don't tell me it's Kaito!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.300
Kaito! Don't tell me that you did something to Lucia...

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:18.710
Eh?

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:20.140
What are you doing?

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:23.590
You two barged in here while wearing shoes.

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:25.240
Eh? Where's Lucia?

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.220
Lucia went home a while ago.

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.580
She went home?

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:29.530
Perfect timing.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.260
Could you return these clothes to her?

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:36.030
She apparently got them wet while cleaning the bathroom.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:39.570
She left all of a sudden before her clothes were dry.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:42.200
Rina, if Lucia isn't here...

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.300
...she might be in real danger.

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:45.480
We need to hurry, Hanon!

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:51.150
How's my burning gaze?

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.500
Your reign is {already}officially over.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:18:00.490
I'm going to use my cute singing to knock you out!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.110
Huh? What is this song?

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.080
It's making me sick!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.520
It sends chills down my spine!

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.210
Lucia!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.900
W-What in the world{the hell}?

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:48.600
Why is this song causing us to feel sick?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:19:01.820
Now, I'm going to take your hearts with a bang!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.520
No! No! What is that?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.560
Now! Hanon! Rina!

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:31.820
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.040
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.370
Green Pearl Voice!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.950
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:58.770
Ahh! No!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:22.990
No! Stop it!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.420
Love Shower Pitch!

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.020
How about an encore?

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:58.930
I won't accept this! Let me have another concert the next time around!

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:14.160
Lucia...

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:51.970
Ahh!

00:23:51.970 --> 00:23:53.380
What's wrong, Lucia?

00:23:53.380 --> 00:23:56.010
The Pearl Piari has been trashed!

00:23:56.010 --> 00:23:56.980
Maybe...

00:23:56.980 --> 00:23:58.310
...it's a thief?

00:23:58.310 --> 00:24:00.050
What in the world did he steal?

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:05.290
I know. The music box that Rihito-san gave you looks pretty expensive.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:07.520
The thief must have been going after that box.

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:08.590
How could that be?

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:10.560
He gave it to me, and now it's stolen!

00:24:10.560 --> 00:24:12.160
I definitely won't forgive this!

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:15.270
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.270 --> 00:24:16.360
The Thief of Memories.

00:24:16.360 --> 00:24:19.810
Come out, you darn thief!
